      "writtenOn": "2017-09-07T21:02:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we\u0027re still in suspend, the port won\u0027t role toggle, so the ways out of SRC_DISCOVERY are:\n\n- Detach, in which case we\u0027ll stay a sink for as long as we\u0027re in suspend, so we\u0027ll never get back to SRC_DISCOVERY.\n\n- The port responds to our source cap, in which case it speaks PD, so we don\u0027t want to go to deep sleep (until detach, see above).",
